p\left(\frac{1}{4}\right)&=\left(\frac{1}{4}-\frac{z^2+\frac{1}{z^2}-2}{-4}\right)\left(\frac{1}{4}-\frac{z^6+\frac{1}{z^6}-2}{-4}\right)\left(\frac{1}{4}-\frac{z^{18}+\frac{1}{z^{18}}-2}{-4}\right)
&=\left(\frac{z^2-1+\frac{1}{z^2}}{4}\right)\left(\frac{z^6-1+\frac{1}{z^6}}{4}\right)\left(\frac{z^{18}-1+\frac{1}{z^{18}}}{4}\right)
&=\frac{1}{64}\left(z^{26}-z^{24}+z^{22}-z^{20}+\dots+\frac{1}{z^{26}}\right)
&=\frac{1}{64}\left(\frac{z^{26}+\frac{1}{z^{28}}}{1+\frac{1}{z^2}}\right)
